    "title": "GATEWAY-apiwizdoc-List Insurance Claims Claims Documents-v4-spec",
    "description": "The Insurance Claims Document Retrieval API allows users to access a comprehensive list of documents associated with various insurance claims. This endpoint is particularly useful for claims adjusters, customers, and stakeholders who need to review claim documents for processing and assessment. Users can retrieve detailed information about each document, such as types, statuses, and dates, facilitating better decision-making and faster claims resolution. This API simplifies the document retrieval process and enhances transparency in insurance claim management.",
